= Kolchak's Coup

On 18 November, officers loyal to Admiral Alexander Kolchak arrested the SR members of the Directory in Omsk, the anti-Bolshevik government that had been formed in Ufa in September from the SR and Kadet delegates. Kolchak proclaimed himself Supreme Ruler. The SRs who had joined the anti-Bolshevik cause, among them Avksentiev and Zenzinov, were deported to the West.

[? if fault_flag = 1 : [+ fault_text +] ?]

The other side of the civil war has now shown its hand. A White Russia would be a dictatorship of the officers, and the socialists, of every party, would be in prison.

[? if player_party = 'menshevik' : For the Mensheviks it is a sign that the policy of "neither side" is not so foolish after all, and that armed struggle against the Bolsheviks can only help the Whites. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and armed_struggle = 1 : The party's own leaders sat in that Directory. It was the party's attempt to make a democratic government with the help of generals, foreign troops and Cossack atamans, and the generals have answered. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' and armed_struggle = 0 : The party had stayed out of the Directory, and its leaders in Moscow, though in prison, have not been shot by officers. ?]

- @sr_pullout: Pull the party's people out of Siberia and break with the Directory's remnants.
- @sr_stay: Stay in the Directory.

@sr_pullout
view-if: player_party = 'sr' and armed_struggle = 1
choose-if: bund_strength >= 4 or rel_kad < 30
unavailable-subtitle: We have had no warning of the coup.
on-arrival: {!
Q.white_aid = Math.max(0, Q.white_aid - 1);
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 3, right_threat: -3});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 6);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -4);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 2, -2);
Q.komuch_alive = 1;
!}

A few days before, the party's delegates withdrew from the Directory, on a warning from the Ufa group that the officers meant to act. They were criticised for deserting their allies, and then thanked, when the others were arrested.

@sr_stay
view-if: player_party = 'sr' and armed_struggle = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.members -= 15 * Q.mem_scale;
Q.komuch_alive = 0;
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: -3, middle: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -6, 8);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 4, 0);
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: -2});
!}

The party's leaders in the Directory were arrested in their beds. Avksentiev, Zenzinov and the others are on a train to Harbin. The party has paid in full for an alliance with the officers.
